From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: m89wppy <zhalin66@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 23:24:30 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 39/42] BlueOS: SystemUI: wallpaper jelly on the part of the
 picture the screen shows, stronger motion, only on a still wallpaper

Fingers were mapped onto the whole picture's width (a wide picture: 1.6x off); the
motion push was ~8x weaker than the approved mockup. The engine now gets the crop the
system shows (getBitmapCrops) and the launcher's offset, logs the jelly's state and
takes adb shell am broadcast -a org.blueos.debug.JELLY_POKE (shell only) for tests.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I89ed784f647ff7d0ce2fdc39ed8ef6caeea840a9
---
 .../wallpaper/BlueOSWallpaperWeather.kt       | 80 +++++++++++++++++--
 .../systemui/wallpapers/ImageWallpaper.java   | 31 +++++--
 2 files changed, 99 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

diff --git a/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/blueos/wallpaper/BlueOSWallpaperWeather.kt b/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/blueos/wallpaper/BlueOSWallpaperWeather.kt
index 8d42f3a866de..09c49e0d7230 100644
